0..73 Comment "// Two proofs by induction over the loops at the book circle\'s point that"
74..149 Comment "// prove nothing. The first forgets to carry the loop: its loop arm answers"
150..221 Comment "// with the rest\'s path, whose endpoints are not the loop\'s. The second"
222..294 Comment "// carries the loop but answers the inverse apart, so the two sides of a"
295..335 Comment "// cancellation are two different paths."
